- ✅ `AsSpan`-based concatenation in `FixedLengthTruncator` left-truncation path (L65-67)
- ✅ `AsSpan`-based concatenation in `FixedNumberOfCharactersTruncator` (L134, L148)
- ✅ Static `DefaultTruncator` instance avoids per-call allocation (L199)
- ✅ Early-exit null/length checks avoid unnecessary work (L43-51, L86-93, L168-173)

